  "description": "ONNX Runtime native bundle with Aardvark-style embedded natives: CUDA on Windows (needs CUDA 12.x + cuDNN 9.x installed; CPU fallback otherwise), CoreML on macOS, CPU + system-CUDA discovery on Linux. Pairs with Microsoft.ML.OnnxRuntime.Managed.",
  "id": "Unofficial.OnnxRuntime",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-06-17T11:14:30.187Z",
