  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 211005045,
  "published": "2026-06-17T11:07:47.933Z",
  "releaseNotes": "- windows: ship the CUDA build of ONNX Runtime instead of DirectML. DirectML;authoring fails (E_INVALIDARG in MLOperatorAuthorImpl) on newer NVIDIA drivers;for some models — a per-driver issue unfixable from here. The CUDA execution;provider (onnxruntime_providers_cuda.dll) is now bundled and used on Windows;;it requires CUDA 12.x + cuDNN 9.x installed on the machine (provider DLLs load;them at session time) and falls back to CPU when absent. Drops the Vortice.DXGI;dependency and the DirectML adapter-selection logic.",
